caption: Learning Rate
domain-rule: learning-rate

Accelerated Training does not use Intensive Training; supervised instruction uses ordinary Education. Determine the learning hours the activity would normally produce, then multiply by four, to a maximum of four learning hours per actual hour. In common cases:

Self-Teaching: 2 learning hours per actual hour.

Education: 4 learning hours per actual hour.

Learning on the Job: 1 learning hour per actual hour.
